                  "value": "Cognitive-behavior therapy for children and adolescents with anxiety disorders: A meta-analysis of secondary outcomes\nhttps://doi.org/10.1016/j.janxdis.2018.10.005"
                },
                "publicationURL": {
                  "typeName": "publicationURL",
